'''Inumusha''' (犬武者 武蔵, ''Inumusha Musashi'') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] enemy introduced in [[Multiversal Studios]], the final stage of [[Walk of Fame]]. He is the enemy version of [[Miyamoku Musashi (Special Cat)|Miyamoku Musashi]]. He was added in [[Version 5.9 Update|Version 5.9]].

