==Enemy==
Inumusha deals high damage but has slow movement speed, with a somewhat slow attack rate. His range is 600 and he has Area Attack, making his attacks devastating to most units. Once he is killed by a non-[[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer]], Inumusha will [[Revive|revive]] one more time, but with only 1/4 of his original health. Unlike most other Zombies, Inumusha cannot [[Burrow|burrow]] past your cats.

His weaknesses are his somewhat slow attack rate and high KB count (every 16,000 damage taken), so it's easy to regain ground against him until the [[Zir Zeal]] in [[Multiversal Studios]] or the [[Dread Bore]] in [[Heavenly Tower]] [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 43|Floor 43]] gets in the way.

